<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Trusted Companion Care for Your Elderly Parents — Garia, Kolkata</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <a class="logo" href="/">Companion Care</a>
  <nav>
    <a href="/caregiver-apply.html">Become a Companion</a>
    <a href="/admin/login.html">Admin</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Reliable, background-checked visits for your elderly parents — even when you can't be there.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Every companion is personally interviewed, reference-checked, and given a supervised
      trial visit before ever being introduced to your family. We serve Garia, Kamdahari,
      and the Baishnabghata-Patuli Township area.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/family-signup.html">Find Care for a Family Member</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/caregiver-apply.html">Apply to Become a Companion</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Safety check-in visits</h3>
      <p>Scheduled visits so someone always knows your parent is okay — daily, a few times a week, or weekly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Companionship</h3>
      <p>A friendly, familiar face for conversation, a walk, or just company through the day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Errands & reminders</h3>
      <p>Medicine pickup, bill payment, and gentle reminders to take medication on schedule.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Every companion is verified</h3>
      <p>ID checked, two references called, and a trial visit personally supervised before any match is made.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="text-align:center; color:#666; font-size:0.9rem;">
    This is a non-medical companionship and support service, not a nursing or medical
    care service. For medical needs, please consult a qualified healthcare provider.
  </p>
</main>

